# Canvas soma-widgets / Soma Connections v6 (8 cards) + Expanded · Unfolded upright (proposed 2026-10-29).
# Isolated fictional checks; no production monitors, network or real notifications.
# canvas-app: soma-widgets
# Card shots name their Canvas card (design gate, tools/walkthrough/README.md); look at each against its card: green ✓ and
# statuses, accent △ and count, body sans for lines and rows, mono only for small captions, rules above [ Restore ].
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez connections true
expect Connections fixture
expect Connections
expect Network
expect Agents
expect Canvas
expect runner not responding
shot connections-small-cover card=connections-small-cover
tap [ Restore ]
expect Restore utility used
expect Repair blocked
# Utility must not open the modal.
absent Close Connections
tap Connections
expect All capabilities
expect Your Fictional Mac is connected.
expect Its runner needs a restart.
expect Restart the agent runner
expect One repair. Two features back.
shot connections-expanded-cover card=connections-expanded-cover
scrollto Details for agents
expect Check again
tap Details for agents
expect fixture_only
shot connections-agent-details-cover
tap Details for agents
scrollto Builds & installs
expect Affected
expect Needs repair
scrollto Optional tools
tap Design Canvas
expect CORE Design Canvas
scrollto Notify me about unexpected outages and recovery
expect After 60 seconds · one alert per incident
tap Notify me about unexpected outages and recovery
scrollto Fixture only
expect Fixture only
key BACK
expect Connections fixture
tap Medium
expect Phone
expect Sync
shot connections-medium-cover card=connections-medium-cover
tap Large
expect Device connections
expect Connected
expect Synced
expect Design Canvas
shot connections-large-cover card=connections-large-cover
tap Active jobs
tap [ Restore ]
expect Repair blocked
tap Connections
expect Blocked: active or queued
key BACK
tap Failed repair
tap [ Restore ]
expect Repair failed
shot connections-failed-cover
tap Connections
expect Failed: fictional
shot connections-failed-details-cover
key BACK
tap Successful repair
tap [ Restore ]
expect Service restored
expect Everything is ready
shot connections-restored-cover
tap Connections
expect Restored: fictional
expect Back in working order.
shot connections-restored-details-cover
key BACK
tap Auth check
tap Connections
expect Auth required
shot connections-auth-cover
key BACK
tap Stale check
tap Connections
expect Stale
key BACK
tap Pause checks
tap Connections
expect Paused
key BACK
# Notification debounce/dedup/recovery and pause are checked in ConnectionsTest; no real Android alerts in this fixture.
fold unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez connections true
expect Connections fixture
shot connections-small-unfolded card=connections-small-unfolded
tap Medium
shot connections-medium-unfolded card=connections-medium-unfolded
tap Large
expect Design Canvas
shot connections-large-unfolded card=connections-large-unfolded
tap Connections
expect All capabilities
expect Your Fictional Mac is connected.
shot connections-expanded-unfolded card=connections-expanded-unfolded
scrollto Notify me about unexpected outages and recovery
expect After 60 seconds · one alert per incident
shot connections-expanded-unfolded-footer
swipe 0.50 0.30 0.50 0.80 500
rotate portrait
expect Connections
expect All capabilities
expect Your Fictional Mac is connected.
expect Optional tools
shot connections-expanded-portrait card=connections-expanded-upright
swipe 0.50 0.70 0.50 0.30 500
scrollto Pause monitoring for 1 hour
expect Fixture only
within 0.10 0.95 Fixture only
shot connections-portrait-scrolled
swipe 0.50 0.30 0.50 0.80 500
swipe 0.50 0.30 0.50 0.80 500
expect All capabilities
rotate landscape
expect Connections
expect All capabilities
shot connections-expanded-rotated
key BACK
expect Connections fixture
[phone] After combined install: add module:connections on an owner-chosen home page via canvas placement; verify real configured peers, core Design Canvas, VPN loss versus auth refusal, helper stale/asleep/paused, source freshness and actual notification permission/channel state. Owner enables alerts in context. Controlled test outage only on an idle test service: wait debounce, observe one local Android alert even with tunnel down, dismiss without repeat, restore externally and verify one recovery. Confirm intentional pause stays quiet and closing detail leaves checks running. Do not stop active builds/agents, toggle security/debugging, reboot hosts or install from this lane. Successful automatic restart remains unavailable until a supported guarded host-control API is deployed.
